# Provider credentials are read by OpenMinion's own config, NOT by this app.
# Configure a provider once with:
#   openminion setup --no-chat
# and keep any API keys in your environment / OpenMinion config only.
# Examples of variables OpenMinion providers may read:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# (For a local model, run Ollama and select it in `openminion setup`.)
